do MouseManager.set_mouse_mode_visible()
Intercom: Voting will now comence
[i]You look down at the screen. An option has appeared asking for which of your opponents you've decided to vote for.[/i]
- Alastair
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_vote_target("artsy")
- Frank
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_vote_target("jock")
- Kelly
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_vote_target("mean")
- Damien
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_vote_target("nerd")
- Melanie
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_vote_target("nice")
Intercom: The votes have now been placed. Please choose who you wish to dodge.
[i]The screen has changed and an option to dodge someone has appeared.[/i]
- Alastair
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_dodge_target("artsy")
- Frank
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_dodge_target("jock")
- Kelly
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_dodge_target("mean")
- Damien
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_dodge_target("nerd")
- Melanie
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_dodge_target("nice")
- No One
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_dodge_target("no one")
do GameplayRound1Tracker.run_round_votes()
[i]A moment of silence passes before a voice returns over the intercom[/i]
Intercom: Thank you for voting. The results will now be displayed on your screen.
[i]You quickly check the results and see[/i]
Number of votes per participant\
Alastair\: {GameplayRound1Tracker.num_artsy_votes}\
Frank\: {GameplayRound1Tracker.num_jock_votes}\
Kelly\: {GameplayRound1Tracker.num_mean_votes}\
Damien\: {GameplayRound1Tracker.num_nerd_votes}\
Melanie\: {GameplayRound1Tracker.num_nice_votes}\
You\: {GameplayRound1Tracker.num_player_votes}
if {GameplayRound1Tracker.num_player_votes} == 3.0:
	[i]Three! The result hits you all at once[/i]
[i]The screen flickers and the display changes[/i]
Number of remaining lives per participant\
Alastair\: {GameplayRound1Tracker.artsy_lives}\
Frank\: {GameplayRound1Tracker.jock_lives}\
Kelly\: {GameplayRound1Tracker.mean_lives}\
Damien\: {GameplayRound1Tracker.nerd_lives}\
Melanie\: {GameplayRound1Tracker.nice_lives}\
You\: {GameplayRound1Tracker.player_lives}
if {GameplayRound1Tracker.player_lives} == 0.0:
	jump player_loss
if {GameplayRound1Tracker.convinced_nice_to_participate} != true:
	Intercom: As player Melanie did not choose a vote target in time, she has been deducted two hearts.
if {GameplayRound1Tracker.nice_lives} == 0.0:
	jump nice_loss
label Second Round
Intercom: As no player has been eliminated yet, we will continue to the next round of voting.
[i]You look back down at your screen once again. The voting options have returned[/i]
- Alastair
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_vote_target("artsy")
- Frank
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_vote_target("jock")
- Kelly
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_vote_target("mean")
- Damien
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_vote_target("nerd")
- Melanie
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_vote_target("nice")
Intercom: The votes have now been placed. Please choose who you wish to dodge.
[i]The screen has changed and an option to dodge someone has appeared.[/i]
- Alastair
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_dodge_target("artsy")
- Frank
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_dodge_target("jock")
- Kelly
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_dodge_target("mean")
- Damien
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_dodge_target("nerd")
- Melanie
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_dodge_target("nice")
- No One
	do GameplayRound1Tracker.set_player_dodge_target("no one")
do GameplayRound1Tracker.calculate_second_round_vote_targets()
do GameplayRound1Tracker.run_round_votes()


do MouseManager.set_mouse_mode_captured()
do GameplayerManager.end_gameplay()
label player_loss
[i]Everyone looks over at you in pity. You can feel the floor beneath you start to move. Who was it, who voted for you[/i]
[i]*KKKRRRRRRNK*[/i]
[i]The grating of the platform beneath you is the last thing you hear as you plunge into the abyss below[/i]
do GameplayerManager.go_to_loss_screen()
[end_timeline]
label nice_loss
do OpponentStatusTracker.opponent_died("nice")
do GameplayerManager.end_gameplay()
[end_timeline]